### Submit Python solution for Even or Odd (Problem 2)  
POST http://localhost:8080/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problem_id": 2,
  "code": "n = int(input())\nif n % 2 == 0:\n    print('Even')\nelse:\n    print('Odd')",
  "language": "python"
}

###

### Submit Go solution for Find Maximum (Problem 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "problem_id": 3,
  "code": "package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\tvar n int\n\tfmt.Scan(&n)\n\t\n\tmax := -1000000\n\tfor i := 0; i < n; i++ {\n\t\tvar num int\n\t\tfmt.Scan(&num)\n\t\tif num > max {\n\t\t\tmax = num\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\t\n\tfmt.Println(max)\n}",
  "language": "go"
}

